# The build output www/ IS committed: it is what Cloudflare Pages serves from this repository on
# every push to main (project root directory `www`, no build command). It is derived from content/
# and agsc.config.json by `agsc build`, never authored; rebuild it before committing, and let the
# monthly report tool re-place /.well-known/sustainability-data and its header rule after the build.
.wrangler

# Secrets. A tracked `.env` is a lint error in its own right (AGSC-01-37, AGSC-E403).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local tooling
node_modules/
.agsc/

# Editor and platform noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Written by `agsc ci` and `agsc conform`: generated, not committed in this repository.
dist/
